msgstr "Exposed: next fight Vulnerable"

#: scripts/flow/journey_rules.gd:47
msgid "Exposto: a equipe começa Vulnerável."
msgstr "Exposed: the team starts Vulnerable."

#: scripts/flow/journey_rules.gd:48
